sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy ext_authz<br/>Sidecar Proxy
    participant API as batch-gateway-apiserver<br/>HTTP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP
    participant Proc as batch-gateway-processor
    participant LLMd as llm-d Inference<br/>Gateway<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GC as batch-gateway-gc
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Batch Job Submission Flow

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/batches<br/>Batch inference request
    Envoy->>Envoy: ext_authz validation
    Envoy->>API: Forward with identity headers<br/>(TenantID, RequestID)
    API->>S3: Upload batch input file<br/>AWS SDK v2
    S3-->>API: Upload confirmation
    API->>PG: Create batch job record<br/>pgx driver
    PG-->>API: Job ID
    API->>Redis: Enqueue batch job<br/>go-redis
    Redis-->>API: Ack
    API-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>Job ID + status

    Note over Client,OTel: Batch Job Processing Flow

    Proc->>Redis: Dequeue next job<br/>go-redis polling
    Redis-->>Proc: Batch job payload
    Proc->>PG: Update job state → processing
    Proc->>S3: Download input file
    S3-->>Proc: Batch input data

    loop For each inference request in batch
        Proc->>LLMd: POST inference request<br/>(async/global/per-model mode)
        LLMd-->>Proc: Inference result
    end

    Proc->>S3: Upload output file
    S3-->>Proc: Upload confirmation
    Proc->>PG: Update job state → completed

    Note over Client,OTel: Garbage Collection Flow

    GC->>PG: Scan for expired batch jobs
    PG-->>GC: Expired job list
    GC->>S3: Remove expired files
    S3-->>GC: Deletion confirmation
    GC->>PG: Remove expired records

    opt Orphan Reconciliation (when enabled)
        GC->>Redis: Detect orphaned jobs<br/>(cancelled, expired, failed)
        Redis-->>GC: Orphan list
        GC->>PG: CAS cleanup with conflict tracking
    end

    Note over Client,OTel: Observability (all binaries)

    API->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    Proc->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    GC->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC
